            correct: 2,
            exp: "Prostate adenocarcinoma arises overwhelmingly (70-80%) in the Peripheral Zone, which is why it can be palpated on a Digital Rectal Exam (DRE) and usually does not cause early urinary obstruction. BPH arises in the Transition Zone.",
