            exp: "This is Reye syndrome, a fatal mitochondrial hepatopathy causing fulminant liver failure and encephalopathy in children given aspirin during a viral illness (usually VZV or Influenza). The hallmark histologic finding is microvesicular steatosis (small fat droplets in hepatocytes) without inflammation.",
