            topic: "Pancreatic Pathology", difficulty: "Normal", source: "Pathoma",
            question: "A 50-year-old male presents with severe epigastric pain radiating to his back, nausea, and vomiting. Serum amylase and lipase are markedly elevated. The pathogenesis of this acute condition is driven by the premature, intra-pancreatic activation of which specific enzyme?",
