            correct: 0,
            exp: "Fibroadenomas are the most common benign breast tumor in women under 35. They are composed of both fibrous and glandular tissue. Because they are estrogen-sensitive, they typically grow during pregnancy and fluctuate with the menstrual cycle. They are highly mobile ('breast mouse').",
