            question: "A 60-year-old woman is diagnosed with breast cancer. The biopsy reveals a lack of duct formation; instead, the malignant cells are invading the stroma in a classic 'single-file' line. This specific histological pattern is due to an acquired mutation in the CDH1 gene, which results in the loss of what adhesion protein?",
