            exp: "Zenker diverticulum is a false diverticulum (involving only mucosa) that herniates through the Killian triangle, an area of muscular weakness between the thyropharyngeal and cricopharyngeal parts of the inferior pharyngeal constrictor muscle. The trapped food rots, causing severe halitosis.",
