            correct: 1,
            exp: "Autoimmune hepatitis classically affects young females. It is characterized by hypergammaglobulinemia, elevated liver transaminases, a prominent plasma cell infiltrate on liver biopsy, and positive Anti-Smooth Muscle Antibodies (ASMA) or Anti-Nuclear Antibodies (ANA).",
