            exp: "Renal Cell Carcinoma (specifically the clear cell variant, which is the most common) arises from the epithelial cells of the Proximal Convoluted Tubule (PCT). It appears as polygonal cells with clear cytoplasm because they are packed with glycogen and lipids.",
