            exp: "The VHL protein normally ubiquitinates and destroys Hypoxia Inducible Factor (HIF). When VHL is mutated/lost, HIF accumulates continuously. HIF acts as a transcription factor that upregulates VEGF (causing angiogenesis) and Erythropoietin (EPO), leading to paraneoplastic polycythemia.",
