            exp: "Doxorubicin (and other anthracyclines like Daunorubicin) is famously cardiotoxic. It generates free radicals that destroy the myocardium, leading to an irreversible Dilated Cardiomyopathy. The cardioprotective agent Dexrazoxane (an iron chelator) is sometimes given with Doxorubicin to prevent this toxicity.",
