            question: "A 16-year-old basketball player collapses and dies during a game. Autopsy reveals massive Hypertrophic Cardiomyopathy (HCM). In familial cases of HCM, the disease is inherited in an autosomal dominant pattern. The most common genetic mutations responsible for this disease occur in genes encoding for which class of proteins?",
