            exp: "The Abdominal Aorta is the most severely affected site for atherosclerosis, followed by the Coronary arteries, Popliteal arteries, Internal carotids, and the Circle of Willis. This is why abdominal aortic aneurysms are so intensely common in patients with severe atherosclerosis.",
