            exp: "The carotid sinus baroreceptors transmit signals regarding blood pressure to the brainstem via Cranial Nerve IX (Glossopharyngeal). The aortic arch baroreceptors transmit their signals via Cranial Nerve X (Vagus). The efferent (outgoing) parasympathetic response to the heart is carried entirely by the Vagus nerve.",
