            exp: "Jervell and Lange-Nielsen syndrome is an autosomal recessive disorder caused by a mutation in potassium channels. It classically presents with the deadly combination of congenital sensorineural deafness and a prolonged QT interval (which predisposes to Torsades de Pointes and sudden cardiac death). Romano-Ward syndrome is the autosomal dominant version and lacks deafness.",
