            question: "A 30-year-old male presents with episodic dark urine, mostly occurring in the morning. He also has a history of unprovoked deep vein thromboses. Flow cytometry of his red blood cells reveals an absence of CD55 and CD59. This disease is caused by an acquired mutation in which specific gene?",
