            exp: "Primary Biliary Cholangitis (formerly Cirrhosis) is an autoimmune granulomatous destruction of intrahepatic bile ducts. It classically affects middle-aged women presenting with intense pruritus. Anti-Mitochondrial Antibodies (AMA) are highly specific and diagnostic.",
