            exp: "In Autoimmune Gastritis, T-cells and autoantibodies destroy the Parietal cells located in the body and fundus of the stomach. Parietal cells secrete gastric acid and Intrinsic Factor. The loss of Intrinsic Factor prevents the absorption of Vitamin B12 in the terminal ileum, leading to pernicious anemia.",
