            question: "A 45-year-old male with a history of mechanical aortic valve replacement presents with fatigue. Labs show a normocytic anemia. Peripheral smear shows numerous schistocytes. Which of the following lab profiles would confirm this diagnosis of intravascular hemolysis?",
