            question: "A patient with a history of recurrent pancreatitis presents with severe abdominal pain. Imaging shows a ring of pancreatic tissue completely encircling the second part of the duodenum, causing a partial obstruction. This 'Annular Pancreas' is caused by the abnormal migration of which embryological structure?",
