            question: "A 40-year-old female presents with rheumatoid arthritis and a normocytic anemia. Her labs show a high ferritin level, a remarkably low Total Iron Binding Capacity (TIBC), and a low serum iron. This Anemia of Chronic Disease is driven by the hepatic production of which acute-phase reactant?",
