            exp: "Adenoid Cystic Carcinoma is a malignant salivary gland tumor famous for its cribriform (Swiss-cheese) histological pattern. It is notorious for exhibiting highly aggressive Perineural Invasion (growing along and wrapping around nerves), which causes early, severe pain and makes surgical eradication extremely difficult.",
