            exp: "The ΔF508 mutation deletes a single phenylalanine. The CFTR protein is actually synthesized and could partially function, but it is misfolded. The cell's quality control mechanism in the Rough Endoplasmic Reticulum (RER) recognizes the misfolding, tags it with ubiquitin, and destroys it in the proteasome before it ever reaches the cell membrane.",
