            exp: "Kwashiorkor is severe protein malnutrition. Because the exocrine pancreas is essentially a massive factory that constantly synthesizes and secretes digestive proteins, it is profoundly sensitive to amino acid depletion. The acinar cells rapidly undergo profound Atrophy, leading to an acquired exocrine pancreatic insufficiency.",
